dn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/d2f0fb0bdc5c70047320e84a4c47ae24", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7334310, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%90%83%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A9%E8%A2%AB%E9%80%81%E6%80%A5%E8%AF%8A%20%E8%83%83%E9%87%8C%E5%8F%96%E5%87%BA3%E6%96%A4%E6%AE%8B%E6%B8%A3", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%90%83%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A9%E8%A2%AB%E9%80%81%E6%80%A5%E8%AF%8A+%E8%83%83%E9%87%8C%E5%8F%96%E5%87%BA3%E6%96%A4%E6%AE%8B%E6%B8%A3"}, {"id": 6, "title": "德约科维奇用中文感谢全场球迷", "desc": "近日，在中网男单第二轮，德约科维奇2比1战胜中国选手布云朝克特。赛后，德约用中文感谢全场球迷：“你好吗，谢谢你们的支持！”", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/12e044a8aef1786e0762f0acbc911cba", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7234088, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%BE%B7%E7%BA%A6%E7%A7%91%E7%BB%B4%E5%A5%87%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87%E6%84%9F%E8%B0%A2%E5%85%A8%E5%9C%BA%E7%90%83%E8%BF%B7", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%BE%B7%E7%BA%A6%E7%A7%91%E7%BB%B4%E5%A5%87%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%87%E6%84%9F%E8%B0%A2%E5%85%A8%E5%9C%BA%E7%90%83%E8%BF%B7"}, {"id": 7, "title": "曲棍球队姑娘们赛后都哭了", "desc": "2026亚运会曲棍球女子决赛，中国队0-1惜败印度队，获得银牌，无缘直通洛杉矶奥运会的资格。赛后，姑娘们都流下了遗憾的泪水。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/6e1fbde3a0bad09bf06490c180dc1c47", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7144084, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%9B%B2%E6%A3%8D%E7%90%83%E9%98%9F%E5%A7%91%E5%A8%98%E4%BB%AC%E8%B5%9B%E5%90%8E%E9%83%BD%E5%93%AD%E4%BA%86", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%9B%B2%E6%A3%8D%E7%90%83%E9%98%9F%E5%A7%91%E5%A8%98%E4%BB%AC%E8%B5%9B%E5%90%8E%E9%83%BD%E5%93%AD%E4%BA%86"}, {"id": 8, "title": "阿联酋：迪拜航空事件系恐袭", "desc": "10月2日，阿联酋总统顾问安瓦尔·加尔贾什表示，迪拜航空客机驾驶舱冲突事件系“恐袭行为”。9月30日，阿联酋迪拜飞往以色列特拉维夫航班副驾涉嫌刺伤机长致急降。其他机组人员和乘客制服袭击者后，机组重新控制飞机。目前迪拜航空已暂停往返以色列航班。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/b58cc7ccfb8958556f5b533a927e0523", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7041455, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%98%BF%E8%81%94%E9%85%8B%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%AA%E6%8B%9C%E8%88%AA%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E7%B3%BB%E6%81%90%E8%A2%AD", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%98%BF%E8%81%94%E9%85%8B%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%AA%E6%8B%9C%E8%88%AA%E7%A9%BA%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E7%B3%BB%E6%81%90%E8%A2%AD"}, {"id": 9, "title": "“99元租豪车”靠谱吗", "desc": "近日，国庆假期租车自驾热度走高，网上出现“99元租豪车”等低价广告。这类标价大多只是裸车价，保险、服务费等额外收费，还有不良商家恶意制造车损骗取押金，法官提醒租车要核对全部费用，仔细验车。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/3539164afbdcef18c52e1d97edc626a8", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6944746, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E2%80%9C99%E5%85%83%E7%A7%9F%E8%B1%AA%E8%BD%A6%E2%80%9D%E9%9D%A0%E8%B0%B1%E5%90%97", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E2%80%9C99%E5%85%83%E7%A7%9F%E8%B1%AA%E8%BD%A6%E2%80%9D%E9%9D%A0%E8%B0%B1%E5%90%97"}, {"id": 10, "title": "这些涉及假期的网传信息都是假的", "desc": "近日，媒体粉碎涉及假期出行的虚假信息。网传凭口令可买低价机票，但机票价格由航司统一投放，大额优惠极可疑。此外，社交平台涌现大量“世外桃源”民宿图，同一张图却标注不同景点。记者用反诈中心检测发现，照片均含AI生成痕迹。律师表示，以没房为由推销其他民宿属典型欺诈行为。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/d16ba9e1a349147ab24001b637c08305", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6856356, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%BF%99%E4%BA%9B%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E7%BD%91%E4%BC%A0%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%81%87%E7%9A%84", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%BF%99%E4%BA%9B%E6%B6%89%E5%8F%8A%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E7%BD%91%E4%BC%A0%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%81%87%E7%9A%84"}, {"id": 11, "title": "邵佳一 生涯最大失利", "desc": "近日，针对中国男足0比5惨败巴勒斯坦，邵佳一作出回应。他坦言，这是自己生涯最大失利，心情非常沮丧。但他强调失利是足球的一部分，团队必须迅速调整状态，将注意力放在下一场比赛。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/1c434ded4727368b2cc899ebcff8e041", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6753756, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%82%B5%E4%BD%B3%E4%B8%80%20%E7%94%9F%E6%B6%AF%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%A4%B1%E5%88%A9", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%82%B5%E4%BD%B3%E4%B8%80+%E7%94%9F%E6%B6%AF%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E5%A4%B1%E5%88%A9"}, {"id": 12, "title": "“这是国际社会前所未闻的恶性事件”", "desc": "近日，中国驻日使馆发言人就原自卫队官员村田晃大持刀侵闯中国驻日使馆案开庭作出回应，称该事件是国际社会前所未闻的恶性事件，严重侵害中方主权与馆舍安全，敦促日方严惩凶手、彻查整改并给出负责任交代。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/7dc7175b28ced3ae66ae3b76b60b8f75", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6660117, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E2%80%9C%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%89%8D%E6%89%80%E6%9C%AA%E9%97%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%81%B6%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E2%80%9D", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E2%80%9C%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A%E5%89%8D%E6%89%80%E6%9C%AA%E9%97%BB%E7%9A%84%E6%81%B6%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E2%80%9D"}, {"id": 13, "title": "全国各地为何都在“爆改地铁”", "desc": "近期，全国多地地铁站被改造成运动馆、菜市场等多元空间。事件起因于地铁票务收入难抵高昂运维成本，且此前依赖房地产反补收入的路径受阻。为寻求出路，地铁运营方转变思路，从早期单纯出租空间收租，转向参与招商管理及打造体育、阅读等生活方式场景，试图在存量时代通过精细化经营挖掘增量空间。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/2eedb98e2cbdcae85b5728af4bff23db", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6570940, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%90%84%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E9%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E2%80%9C%E7%88%86%E6%94%B9%E5%9C%B0%E9%93%81%E2%80%9D", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BD%E5%90%84%E5%9C%B0%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E9%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E2%80%9C%E7%88%86%E6%94%B9%E5%9C%B0%E9%93%81%E2%80%9D"}, {"id": 14, "title": "中国男足争亚运铜牌", "desc": "10月3日，中国男足亚运队将在铜牌赛中迎战乌兹别克斯坦队。这支青年军本届赛事表现可圈可点，中国男足时隔28年再度晋级四强，半决赛被卫冕冠军韩国队逆转后，全队上下都铆足一股劲，希望带一枚亚运奖牌回国。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/2a1162a1e236b9e034b9c8d26897f97c", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6464698, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E8%B6%B3%E4%BA%89%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90%E9%93%9C%E7%89%8C", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E8%B6%B3%E4%BA%89%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90%E9%93%9C%E7%89%8C"}, {"id": 15, "title": "“饿死肿瘤”的方法竟然真找到了", "desc": "研究发现，短期禁食或模拟禁食饮食可调节免疫代谢，放大肿瘤免疫治疗效果，辅助抗癌。但该手段属于医疗干预，并非自行饿肚子就能“饿死肿瘤”，普通人不可随意尝试，存在健康风险。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/99d538b45a56c8f69fe89f1b926f27d1", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6380214, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E2%80%9C%E9%A5%BF%E6%AD%BB%E8%82%BF%E7%98%A4%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E7%AB%9F%E7%84%B6%E7%9C%9F%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%86", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E2%80%9C%E9%A5%BF%E6%AD%BB%E8%82%BF%E7%98%A4%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%E7%AB%9F%E7%84%B6%E7%9C%9F%E6%89%BE%E5%88%B0%E4%BA%86"}, {"id": 16, "title": "国足没找回信心反崩了盘", "desc": "10月2日晚，中国男足在重庆国际足球邀请赛中0比5惨败巴勒斯坦队。此前国足不敌新西兰，主帅邵佳一期望凭借对阵对手的历史不败战绩找回信心。本场国足防线漏洞频现，开场23分钟连丢两球，下半场连换5人依旧场面混乱，最终大比分崩盘落败。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/2362968b81a61a22fa5e99780bd845d3", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6283563, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%9B%BD%E8%B6%B3%E6%B2%A1%E6%89%BE%E5%9B%9E%E4%BF%A1%E5%BF%83%E5%8F%8D%E5%B4%A9%E4%BA%86%E7%9B%98", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%9B%BD%E8%B6%B3%E6%B2%A1%E6%89%BE%E5%9B%9E%E4%BF%A1%E5%BF%83%E5%8F%8D%E5%B4%A9%E4%BA%86%E7%9B%98"}, {"id": 17, "title": "15万人广场上她把孩子交给女警", "desc": "10月1日晚，云南玉溪15万人涌入聂耳文化广场，参加“同唱一首歌 同为一家人”国庆群众合唱活动。一位独自带娃的妈妈因如厕不便，将孩子交给执勤女警王娟。王娟怕警灯闪到孩子眼睛，特地用手挡住肩灯并让同事将肩灯关闭。这一幕，让国庆之夜有了更多温度。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/fba1980b873ed18b103c2a8e385081a4", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6179767, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=15%E4%B8%87%E4%BA%BA%E5%B9%BF%E5%9C%BA%E4%B8%8A%E5%A5%B9%E6%8A%8A%E5%AD%A9%E5%AD%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99%E5%A5%B3%E8%AD%A6", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=15%E4%B8%87%E4%BA%BA%E5%B9%BF%E5%9C%BA%E4%B8%8A%E5%A5%B9%E6%8A%8A%E5%AD%A9%E5%AD%90%E4%BA%A4%E7%BB%99%E5%A5%B3%E8%AD%A6"}, {"id": 18, "title": "韩媒：中国男足这样还能进世界杯吗", "desc": "近日，韩国媒体撰文点评国足0-5惨败巴勒斯坦，质疑其晋级世界杯前景。在中国之队锦标赛重庆赛中，国足主场0-5不敌巴勒斯坦队，实时排名下滑至第94位。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/e542697245dcf39e91b90f3846b68e2d", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6090564, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%9F%A9%E5%AA%92%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E8%B6%B3%E8%BF%99%E6%A0%B7%E8%BF%98%E8%83%BD%E8%BF%9B%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E6%9D%AF%E5%90%97", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%9F%A9%E5%AA%92%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%94%B7%E8%B6%B3%E8%BF%99%E6%A0%B7%E8%BF%98%E8%83%BD%E8%BF%9B%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E6%9D%AF%E5%90%97"}, {"id": 19, "title": "这些“抢票偏方”真的靠谱吗", "desc": "近日，铁科院专家就假期抢票误区发声。此前有网友花1万多元在12306下多个候补订单未抢到票。专家澄清，候补购票为免费服务，建议用足60个“日期+车次”组合，勿重复下单。针对第三方“加速包”，专家指其在车票售罄时无法加速，所谓“全能抢票”实为将免费候补包装成收费服务，误导消费者增加出行成本。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/efb87b837d14131e1b1f3ec048826d7f", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5999643, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%BF%99%E4%BA%9B%E2%80%9C%E6%8A%A2%E7%A5%A8%E5%81%8F%E6%96%B9%E2%80%9D%E7%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%A0%E8%B0%B1%E5%90%97", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%BF%99%E4%BA%9B%E2%80%9C%E6%8A%A2%E7%A5%A8%E5%81%8F%E6%96%B9%E2%80%9D%E7%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E9%9D%A0%E8%B0%B1%E5%90%97"}, {"id": 20, "title": "亚运三金到手 归来仍是高中生", "desc": "9月29日，不到18岁的高中生陈妤颉在亚运会4x100米混合接力中极限逆转夺冠，最终斩获3金1银。赛后她表现“松弛”，笑称奖牌太重。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/4b6bcb07ecddca52e9274766292d02cd", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5892554, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90%E4%B8%89%E9%87%91%E5%88%B0%E6%89%8B%20%E5%BD%92%E6%9D%A5%E4%BB%8D%E6%98%AF%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E7%94%9F", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%90%E4%B8%89%E9%87%91%E5%88%B0%E6%89%8B+%E5%BD%92%E6%9D%A5%E4%BB%8D%E6%98%AF%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E7%94%9F"}, {"id": 21, "title": "黄河“鸳鸯锅”出圈", "desc": "国庆假期，甘肃临夏州永靖县刘家峡国家级旅游度假区迎来大量客流。此前，黄河与洮河在此交汇，因“一半碧蓝一半黄”形成“鸳鸯锅”景致。游客赏美景、品黄河大鲤鱼等美食、看非遗傩舞等民俗。该景致带动了县域经济，成为乡村振兴的重要文旅支撑。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/9fd3a03e76846ecf6230a30d933fec8b", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5812005, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%BB%84%E6%B2%B3%E2%80%9C%E9%B8%B3%E9%B8%AF%E9%94%85%E2%80%9D%E5%87%BA%E5%9C%88", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%BB%84%E6%B2%B3%E2%80%9C%E9%B8%B3%E9%B8%AF%E9%94%85%E2%80%9D%E5%87%BA%E5%9C%88"}, {"id": 22, "title": "跑4个服务区排队3小时才充上电", "desc": "这个国庆假期，高速服务区新能源车排队充电的“名场面”再次上演。云南一车主连跑4个服务区排队3小时才充上电，四川一车主排队4.5小时且充电被限量。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/26a76171654169b20e19bc9adf27f550", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5696961, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%B7%914%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%8C%BA%E6%8E%92%E9%98%9F3%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6%E6%89%8D%E5%85%85%E4%B8%8A%E7%94%B5", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%B7%914%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%8C%BA%E6%8E%92%E9%98%9F3%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6%E6%89%8D%E5%85%85%E4%B8%8A%E7%94%B5"}, {"id": 23, "title": "吴易昺争奥运席位", "desc": "10月3日，第三次参加亚运会的吴易昺将在网球男单决赛中面对老对手黄泽林。三年前的杭州亚运会，正是这名中国香港队选手将吴易昺挡在八强之外。由于亚运单打冠军将获得一张洛杉矶奥运会门票，吴易昺势必全力以赴。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/02de213c44218ac4ee2ea161cd614ac1", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5610623, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%90%B4%E6%98%93%E6%98%BA%E4%BA%89%E5%A5%A5%E8%BF%90%E5%B8%AD%E4%BD%8D", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%90%B4%E6%98%93%E6%98%BA%E4%BA%89%E5%A5%A5%E8%BF%90%E5%B8%AD%E4%BD%8D"}, {"id": 24, "title": "“像造车一样盖房”真的来了", "desc": "从“露天工地”到“智能工厂”，从“现场浇筑”到“模块吊装”，从“手工粗放”到“数控精造”……当前，以模块化建造为代表的装配式建筑正迈入规模化发展轨道，“像造车一样盖房”，建筑业正在向智能化、绿色化、融合化转型。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/d04448649ec6b5ab4d3eeb343ef3a6a6", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5522958, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E2%80%9C%E5%83%8F%E9%80%A0%E8%BD%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B7%E7%9B%96%E6%88%BF%E2%80%9D%E7%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%A5%E4%BA%86", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E2%80%9C%E5%83%8F%E9%80%A0%E8%BD%A6%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B7%E7%9B%96%E6%88%BF%E2%80%9D%E7%9C%9F%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%A5%E4%BA%86"}, {"id": 25, "title": "Zara新品裙子上线就售罄：6000多一条", "desc": "近日，Zara官方app上线了John Galliano（网友称“海盗爷”）与Zara的合作系列 Re {form} 第一辑。抢购来得比想象中更猛，上线不到10分钟，围巾、手套等相对日常的款式就被抢空。从300多元的围巾手套，到6000多元的连衣裙，几乎全线售罄。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/4e9a504f18226f6afcee4e3b19210db3", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5423705, "url": 